// Article 3. Distributions.
#require "2-decisions.charter".
Use poll(usd) As payout From 3.1
Fact paid Identified by person * usd
Power distribute Actor company Related to usd
  Valid when payout-majority(usd) && usd <= cash
  Creates (Foreach capital: paid(capital.person, MulDivRound(usd, capital.int, total-capital, Floor)))
        , cash(cash - Sum(Foreach capital: MulDivRound(usd, capital.int, total-capital, Floor)))
  Terminates (Foreach person: payout-yes(person, usd))

Clause 3.1 => payout-vote, distribute
Clause 3.2 => paid, cash, distribute.
